  "job_B8.4.3.3_20251003_114855": {
    "chunk_text": "s folces hlyste; He eode into cafarnaum. \u00dea w\u00e6s sumes hundredmannes \u00feeowa untrum, se w\u00e6s sweltendlic, se w\u00e6s him dyre. And \u00fea he gehyrde be \u00feam H\u00e6lende he sende to him Iudea ealdras & b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t he come, & hys \u00feeow \u00dea hi to \u00feam H\u00e6lende comun, hi b\u00e6don hyne geornlice & \u00feus cw\u00e6don, He is wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u him tilige, \u00dea ferde se H\u00e6lend mid him, & \u00fea he w\u00e6s unfeor \u00feam huse se hundredmann sende hys frynd to him & Ic ne eom an man under anwealde gesett; cempan under me h\u00e6bbende. & ic secge \u00feissum, ga, & he g\u00e6\u00f0, & ic secge \u00feissum, cum, \u00feonne cym\u00f0 he, & ic secge minum \u00feeowe, \u00d0a wundrude se H\u00e6lend \u00feam gehyredum, & cw\u00e6\u00fe to \u00fe\u00e6re menigeo bewend, So\u00felice ic secge eow ne & \u00fea \u00f0a ham comon \u00f0e asende w\u00e6ron hig gemetton halne \u00feone \u00fee \u00e6r untrum w\u00e6s. \u00dea w\u00e6s sy\u00f0\u00f0an geworden he ferde on \u00fea ceastre \u00fee is genemned Naim & mid him ferdun hys \u00dea he geneal\u00e6hte \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre gate \u00fea w\u00e6s \u00fear an dead man geboren anre wudewan sunu \u00fee nanne \u00dea se H\u00e6lend hig geseah \u00fea w\u00e6s he mid mildheortnesse ofer hig gefylled, & cw\u00e6\u00fe to hyre, ne wep \u00feu \u00d0a geneal\u00e6hte he & \u00fea cyste \u00e6thran, \u00fea \u00e6tstodon \u00fea \u00fee hyne b\u00e6ron; \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend, eala \u00d0a aras se \u00fe",
